      "id": "claim_b4779affc927462598ff63bc2789d99b",
      "statement": "packages/rules-engine-11e/src/detachment-validator.ts is the sole implementation of the matched-play structural checks; it exposes validatePointsLimit (POINTS_EXCEEDED), validateDetachmentPoints (DP_EXCEEDED), validateRuleOfThree (RULE_OF_THREE) and validateAttachments (ORPHAN_ATTACHMENT), all returning ValidationError[] with severity 'ERROR' | 'WARNING' but in practice only ever emitting 'ERROR', and validateRoster simply concatenates them in the order points, DP, Rule of Three, attachments.",
