      "statement": "Before calling the engine, the audit route performs its own drift detection against freshly fetched datasheets: a unit whose datasheetId is absent produces a RED INVALID_LOADOUT discrepancy and is skipped for downstream checks, while a mismatch between Datasheet.basePoints and the recorded unit.pointsCost produces the only server-side AMBER POINTS_SHIFT discrepancy with oldValue/newValue point strings.",
